>
  <p class="lead-para">
    <strong>People who dropped out of school or college can restart through open schooling, bridge courses, skill programmes, part-time or distance study and apprenticeships, and since recognition and eligibility rules vary, the safest route is to verify each option on official pages, take one realistic first step and build proof of skill alongside.</strong> The decisions that unlock high income opportunities include choosing a branch early and building a high-income skill portfolio of finished work, because AI can handle routine tasks but cannot take responsibility for your results.
  </p>

